01:10:03,157 --> 01:10:09,157
Clouds is a 2020 American biographical romantic musical drama teen film directed and produced by Justin
Baldoni and written by Kara Holden from a story by Holden, Patrick Kopka, and Casey La Scala.

12
01:16:25,263 --> 01:16:31,263
It is based upon the memoir Fly a Little Higher: How God Answered a
Mom's Small Prayer in a Big Way by Laura Sobiech.

13
01:22:47,368 --> 01:22:53,368
The film stars Fin Argus, Sabrina Carpenter, Madison Iseman, Neve Campbell, Tom Everett Scott, and Lil Rel Howery, and tells the story of Zach Sobiech,
a teenager from Minnesota who has osteosarcoma, and decides to follow his dream of becoming a musician after finding out he is dying.

14
